+## 8. View Analysis Mode
+
+After training, run detailed per-view analysis:
+
+```bash
+python m2f_train_multiview.py \
+    --config-file configs/scannetpp/panoptic-segmentation/multiview_mapanything.yaml \
+    --eval-only \
