+#SBATCH --output=logs/labels_%j.out   # Standard output log
+#SBATCH --error=logs/labels_%j.err    # Standard error log
+
+# =============================================================================
+# SCANNET++ LABEL GENERATION JOB - RESUMABLE
+# Generates 2D panoptic labels from rasterization cache
